I actually figured out something by checking console and guessing. Seemed to do something (that array is like the equipment type ids, also you need to change the actor reference to the menuActor or whatever):
$gameActors.actor(1).forceChangeEquipSlots([1,2,3,4,5,5,5]);
$gameActors.actor(1).updateChangedSlots();
SceneManager._scene._slotWindow.refresh();
EDIT: You need to be in the Scene_Equip for that last line to work.
